exports.description:
The heading the reader is in, from each heading's position (in document order):
- the first heading inside the reading band, if any;
- otherwise the last heading already scrolled past (its section is still on screen below it);
- otherwise null (the reader is above the first heading: nothing is active yet).
Unknown positions (a heading the observer has not reported) count as `below`.

